 can vary by daily schedule.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"columbus-metropolitan-library-main-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Columbus Metropolitan Library Main Library","title":"Browse Main Library","subtitle":"96 South Grant Avenue, downtown Columbus","notes":"Use the Main Library as a quiet afternoon stop: browse, find a seat, or ask staff about its local-history and research resources.","short_summary":"A downtown public-library stop for reading and research.","evidence_claim":"Columbus Metropolitan Library invites visitors to Main Library for in-person local history and genealogy research help.","source_url":"https://www.columbuslibrary.org/","source_title":"Columbus Metropolitan Library","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Main Library is at 96 S. Grant Ave.; check the library’s current location page for hours and service availability.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"book-loft-of-german-village","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"The Book Loft of German Village","title":"End with a Book Loft browse","subtitle":"631 South Third Street, German Village","notes":"Leave time to wander the bookstore’s many rooms and pick a reading nook for a low-key final stop before heading back to campus.","short_summary":"A named independent bookstore in historic German Village.","evidence_claim":"The Book Loft says its Columbus German Village store occupies 32 rooms and is open 10 a.m.–11 p.m. seven days a week.","source_url":"https://bookloft.com/","source_title":"The Book Loft of German Village","source_kind":"business_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Official site lists 10 a.m.–11 p.m. daily; verify before travel, particularly around holidays or special events.",